+    /**
+     * Returns the mock maker identified by the given name.
+     * Built-in mock makers can be referenced using the constants from {@link MockMakers}.
+     * Implementations may cache and return the same instance for repeated lookups of the same mock maker.
+     *
+     * @param mockMaker the mock maker identifier or fully qualified implementation class name;
+     *                 if {@code null}, the runtime default mock maker is returned
+     * @return the mock maker instance
+     * @since 5.14.0
